    "src/melee/ft/chara/ftDonkey/ftDk_SpecialHi.c: If you could extract these flags to a named variable, that'd be great. Also there's usually a base of flags that are combined in different cases, like adding a couple flags for an aerial state. The flags can be found in `ft/forward.h` and we have a helper tool (`cargo run -\n\n[truncated]\n",
